From: Hoki integration <code@lukasrieger.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Register GeoClue recorder for Hoki GPS app

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Hoki diagnostic UI]

--- a/src/main.cpp
+++ b/src/main.cpp
@@ -16,8 +16,11 @@
  */
 
 #include <asteroidapp.h>
+#include <QtQml/qqml.h>
